'' A MODULE'S OWN HEADER MACROS ARE ITS OWN. hp/a's header travels -- its interface names
'' APoint -- but its A_SIZE and A_TWICE stop at the interface: the importer defines both
'' names itself (TKO0305 before), still reaches the exported one qualified, and hp/b's
'' header, which builds on A_SIZE after hp/a's interface parked it, still sees it.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/hermetic/libs tests/modules/src/hermetic/app/main.tiko -o tests/modules/hermetic.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/hermetic.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3 7 7 10 100 0
